node_modules/
# The credentials store lives at data/settings.json and is covered by the
# `data/` rule below. A bare `settings.json` pattern also matched
# tests/visual/fixtures/settings.json — the redacted fixture the visual
# suite replays — which left the Home baselines unreproducible on a fresh
# clone. capture-fixtures.js fails the capture if a real value ever
# reaches a fixture, so the fixture is safe to track.
data/
.env
.DS_Store
.dev/
*.zip
test-results/
playwright-report/
*.prv